            <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="87f0-637b-734a-22eb">If a Melee Attack made by a Herald of Beelzebub causes any INFECTION MARKERS to be placed on the target model, you can remove up to 1 BLOOD MARKER from the attacking Herald of Beelzebub.</characteristic>
