              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Add +1 DICE to Risky Success Roll for a Ravenous Infection ACTION (see Ravenous) if the model taking the ACTION is a friendly model within 3” of this Plague Knight.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
